{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧两行大号浅灰标题首先吸引视线：“未必找得回那份亲近 / 先把眼下日子过稳些”。字号、亮度和位置都明显占优；右上角目录和下方音符动画是次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一段亲近关系已经疏远，未必能够恢复，这个人正转而先把眼下的生活安顿好。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"失落、克制，带着接受现实和重新安顿自己的意愿。\",\n  \"missed\": \"害怕其实还没有消失，但脚已经开始往前走；从试探前路到逐渐坚定的变化，需要看下面的小字才能获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"说明文字是一整段较长的多层描述，情绪状态和行动变化需要进一步阅读才能完整理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "32b471c7-f51c-4ba6-a9e4-98c36234429e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023845879107Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:39:16.679095+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1412046ca9a0d6d638473b4185c7ef7e7b68200cde4a34fbf7fb3d36a7d20815", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b